                        <i id="icon1" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs text-brandGreen transition-transform"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div id="ans1" class="hidden mt-2.5 text-xs opacity-90 border-t pt-2 space-y-1">
                        <p><strong>Answer:</strong> Call by Value passes copies; alterations inside the function do not affect original values. Call by Reference passes pointer addresses (<code class="text-brandBlue font-mono">int *x</code>), modifying actual memory locations directly.</p>
