                        <i id="icon2" class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs text-brandGreen transition-transform"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div id="ans2" class="hidden mt-2.5 text-xs opacity-90 border-t pt-2 space-y-1">
                        <p><strong>Answer:</strong> Coffman Conditions: (1) Mutual Exclusion, (2) Hold and Wait, (3) No Preemption, and (4) Circular Wait. If any one condition is broken, deadlock cannot occur.</p>
